    <briefdescription>
<para>An &quot;identifier&quot; for a virtual function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This contains the type identifier represented as a GUID and the offset from the address point to the virtual function pointer, where &quot;address point&quot; is as defined in the Itanium ABI: <ulink url="https://itanium-cxx-abi.github.io/cxx-abi/abi.html#vtable-general">https://itanium-cxx-abi.github.io/cxx-abi/abi.html#vtable-general</ulink> </para>
